        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "about-limits",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "**Limits.** The weights are a judgement, not fitted (there is no open outcome data to fit them to), and like the actions they are not yet reviewed by a practitioner. The Active Ageing Centre list is partial (93 of about 223), so distances overstate the gap where centres are missing. Distances are straight lines, not walking routes. Not official advice. CoolCheck holds no personal data.\n"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
